OL,3,GNEWSACommuters face rush hour delays as
OL,4,ATube lines disrupted by London
OL,5,AUnderground strike
OL,6,
OL,7,F"This is costing us a lot," a cafe
OL,8,Fowner tells the BBC, as he says the
OL,9,Fstrike has led to fewer customers,
OL,10,Fwhile London's Mayor Sadiq Khan is
OL,11,Furging TfL and the RMT to resolve their
OL,12,Fdispute
OL,14,FThe disagreement centres around the
OL,15,Fproposed voluntary introduction of a
OL,16,Ffour-day working week with condensed
OL,17,Fhours. Read more about why drivers are
OL,18,Fstriking
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
